       :raw-text
       "This strategy defines evaluation for AI agents and durable workflows. AI and\nworkflow behavior includes nondeterminism, model providers, prompts, tools,\nmemory, policy, `:ai/human-review`, retries, compensation, and replay. Evaluation\ntherefore combines ordinary tests, recorded traces, safety probes, schema\nvalidation, budget checks, and release gates.\n",
       :source-file-sha256
       "016d272bb500590a6f72230bfbb529d5767c354b0865a876f25fb3a53f81074f",
       :id "testing/partition/test8/352-707",
       :kind :normative-context,
       :document-id "TEST8",
       :end-byte 707,
       :start-byte 352}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-14-testing-verification-and-conformance/197-test8-ai-and-workflow-evaluation-strategy.md",
